---
import Mark from "./Mark.astro";
---

<footer>
  <p class="logout">$ logout</p>
  <Mark />
  <p>
    Read-only. Nothing leaves your machine. <a href="https://github.com/JarenKempton/quench">github.com/JarenKempton/quench</a>
  </p>
  <p class="foot-small">
    Every number is real <code>quench</code> output on a synthetic demo history. Load log, resend and call
    counts: <code>quench runs --json</code> on one demo session. Skills never used: <code>quench profile skills</code>.
    Figures marked derived are arithmetic on those.
  </p>
</footer>
